                                "sense_id": "1bbfdcfe-3c72-3eb2-b768-26e9cb1e94b1",
                                "text": "Tijdens de verkiezingsdag werkte ze als vrijwilliger bij het stembureau.",
                                "translation": "During the election day, she worked as a volunteer at the polling station.",
                                "english": "During the election day, she worked as a volunteer at the polling station."
