                                "sense_id": "1bbfdcfe-3c72-3eb2-b768-26e9cb1e94b1",
                                "text": "Zorg ervoor dat je weet waar je dichtstbijzijnde stembureau is voordat je gaat stemmen.",
                                "translation": "Make sure you know where your nearest polling station is before you go to vote.",
                                "english": "Make sure you know where your nearest polling station is before you go to vote."
                            },
