                                "sense_id": "1bbfdcfe-3c72-3eb2-b768-26e9cb1e94b1",
                                "text": "Het stembureau was open van 7 uur 's ochtends tot 9 uur 's avonds.",
                                "translation": "The polling station was open from 7 am to 9 pm.",
